        "title": "LPJ-GUESS Release v4. 1.1 model code",
        "authors": "Johan Nord and Peter Anthoni and Konstantin Gregor and Adrian Gustafson and Stijn Hantson and Mats Lindeskog and Ben Meyer and Paul Miller and Lars Nieradzik and Stefan Olin and Phillip Papastefanou and Benjamin Smith and Jing Tang and David W\u00e5rlind",
